WEBVTT

00:13:59.667 --> 00:14:00.976
Now where does one go

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:03.143
if you want to get
the support of humanity?

00:14:03.167 --> 00:14:04.976
There's only one place:

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.375
the United Nations.

00:14:07.042 --> 00:14:10.393
Now I've been ambassador to the UN twice.

00:14:10.417 --> 00:14:13.434
Maybe that makes me a bit biased,

00:14:13.458 --> 00:14:18.518
but I can tell you that working
with the UN can lead to success.

00:14:18.542 --> 00:14:20.768
Why is it that the first Iraq war,

00:14:20.792 --> 00:14:23.018
fought by President George H. W. Bush,

00:14:23.042 --> 00:14:24.684
succeeded?

00:14:24.708 --> 00:14:26.309
While the second Iraq war,

00:14:26.333 --> 00:14:29.226
fought by his son,
President George W. Bush,

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:30.601
failed?